## Assessed Topics  
- beneficial ownership above 25%;
- source-of-funds evidence for initial deposits above £10,000;
- enhanced sanctions, PEP, and adverse-media screening;
- Financial Crime referrals and no-tipping-off obligations; and
- quarterly review dates and the account-activation approval gate.  
All learners passed the required knowledge check. Attendance and assessment
records are retained in the learning system for audit sampling.
